# ═══ Draft knowledge entry — Makefile 型 Conan 配方 build()/package() 全套陷阱 ═══
# Timestamp: 2026-09-18
# Software: commander 1.4.0 (clibs/commander)
# Gate: conan-verify G2 (conan create build + test_package)
# Status: UNMATCHED — needs human/AI review to promote to E-entry

id: DRAFT-commander-1.4.0-makefile-recipe-build-package-traps
severity: 2
category: conan|build-system|packaging
trigger_tool: conan
phase: build|package|test_package
approach: build() 中源文件用 self.source_folder 绝对路径、产物写 self.build_folder（basic_layout 下
  self.run() cwd 是 build 目录，非源码根）；package() 复制带子目录的头文件必须 keep_path=False，
  否则落入 include/<src>/ 子目录；编译器一律 self.conf.get("tools.build:compiler_executables",
  default={}, check_type=dict) 取字典键（无 :c 单项 conf，模板写法照抄即抛 conf 异常，R33）

keywords: basic_layout, self.run cwd, self.build_folder, keep_path, include/src, compiler_executables,
  conf does not exist, makefile recipe, no configure, no install target

error_signature: no such file or directory: 'src/.*\.c'|fatal error: '.*\.h' file not found.*test_package|
  \[conf\] 'tools\.build:compiler_executables:c' does not exist in configuration list
match_keywords: basic_layout,self.run,keep_path,compiler_executables,include/src,conanfile,build_folder

root_cause: 裸 Makefile 型库（上游仅 test/clean 目标）在 build() 直调编译器时，Conan 2 basic_layout
  使 self.run() 的 cwd 落在 build-release/ 而非源码根，相对路径源文件解析失败；package() 用
  copy() 复制带路径的头文件时默认 keep_path=True，头文件被装进 include/<src>/ 子目录导致消费方
  找不到；同时 tools.build:compiler_executables 是字典型 conf，模板里 :c 单项写法在 Conan 2.29.1
  抛 "does not exist in configuration list"

affected_scope: 所有无 configure/无 install 的裸 Makefile 型 C/C++ 配方；含 test_package 头文件
  消费路径；从 conanfile-makefile.py.tmpl 生成的配方（模板的 compiler_executables 单项写法需修正）

rec_priority: 1